  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: 873a58b1-9875-459a-ba59-6a7e406a4089
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • Three states operating at losses: North Carolina (-$7,491), Tennessee (-$5,342), Florida (-$3,399)
        • Tables and Machines sub-categories losing $6,060 combined with Tables at -10.5% margin
        • Top 5 loss-making products account for $11,802 in losses (25% of regional profit)
        • Furniture category severely underperforming at 5.8% profit margin vs 13-16% for other categories

        Recommendations:
        • Discontinue or reprice loss-making Tables and Machines products, especially in NC, TN, FL
        • Review pricing strategy for Furniture category to improve 5.8% margin
        • Focus sales efforts on profitable Office Supplies and Technology categories
